WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.602
JEANNE MOOS: What happens
when you put a bunch

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:05.338
of introverted dogs together.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:06.539
Take a look.

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.808
It's worse than the
office Christmas

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.777
party before the liquor flows.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:16.249
Standing apart, all of
them avoiding eye contact.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:20.453
One of the owners described
it as a pasture of cows

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.755
at a dog park in Sweden.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:26.725
This Swedish couple shot
the video that went viral.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:29.228 line:8%
SOFIA ROSTEN: We found a group
that was for introverted dogs

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:33.766 line:8%
and we thought it was perfect
for Qila because she--

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.369 line:8%
JEANNE MOOS: Qila,
a rescued street dog

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:39.839 line:8%
is selective about other
canines and has had only one

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.508 line:14%
best friend, this wiener dog.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:45.178 line:8%
Instead of using the
word, introverted--

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.513 line:8%
TIMMY BONTEGARD:
--gather more calm dogs.

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:50.283
JEANNE MOOS: --Sophia
at Timmy prefer calm.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.585
The meet up lasted an hour.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.954 line:8%
The video shows only
the waning moments

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.724 line:8%
when everyone seemed to have
had enough of each other.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:01.628
Dogs thinking, this
could have been an email.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:05.998
[laughing] The couple found
the group of calm dogs--

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:10.536
SOFIA ROSTEN: It's on Facebook
for different kind of dogs.

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:11.637
JEANNE MOOS:
[inaudible] does not

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.973
seem introverted with you two.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:17.644 line:8%
At the meetup, amid pooches
planted like statues,

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:21.814 line:8%
two of the introverts passed
like ships in the night.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:27.253
And though Qila may be the life
of the party with her owners,

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:30.089
she preferred catching
bugs in her mouth

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:34.960
to catching the eye of
any other introverts.

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:39.065
Jeanne Moos, CNN New York.

